cbc204c91c6d7044e3c505048cd701ddf.600x338.jpg?t=1761890240"}],"short_description":"Ready to step into your very own Japanese coffee shop? From hand-grinding beans to designing the perfect layout, every detail is in your hands. In Kissaten Dream, you serve a cast of unique customers, manage your business, and transform your humble shop into a beloved local gem.","steam_appid":3962500,"support_info":{"email":"play@headphoneturtlegames.com","url":"https://www.headphoneturtlestudios.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.headphoneturtlestudios.com/"}